<p>Your Chants now bathe you in a cloak of light, which increases your stamina and mana regenerations by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">1.10, 1.49, 1.78, 2.03, 2.25</acronym> per turn and does <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 39, 46, 53, 58</acronym> light damage to anyone who hits you in melee.</p><p>These values scale with your Spellpower.</p>